		<title type="html"><![CDATA[New MD-9600/RT-90 Beta version 2025 03 23.]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4993&amp;p=36372#p36372"><![CDATA[
<ul><li> Reapply CSS RX once the DTMF sequence has ended.</li><li> Take care of RD5R display buffer height (48 vs 64 on MK22 platforms).</li><li> Screengrabber Python script takes care of RD5R screen size too.  <ul>  <li> available at <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/K2TF5ZCQJ8#NhIcfp2oKy0R" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/K2TF5ZCQJ8#NhIcfp2oKy0R</a>.</li>  </ul></li><li> Add GPS support for RD5R platform.  <ul>  <li> NOTE: the RSSI screen <strong class="text-strong">doesn't</strong> display the sat's number, as there is no room for this on screen.</li>  </ul></li></ul>The firmwares are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/C3MS9A7SBR#fMg7p9SGnrcP" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/C3MS9A7SBR#fMg7p9SGnrcP</a><br>The voice prompts are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/CT7Y3QE8CC#ivbPuzbV8ty1" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/CT7Y3QE8CC#ivbPuzbV8ty1</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: You <span style="text-decoration:underline">need</span> to use a CPS version greater or equal the the 2025/03/23. See the CPS section <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewforum.php?f=12" class="postlink">viewforum.php?f=12</a><br><br>For translators, the on-screen texts, voice prompts CSV are located at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/AFEPKF84F4#2ltiJXlnndiy" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/AFEPKF84F4#2ltiJXlnndiy</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sun Mar 23, 2025 5:54 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
